---
description: Monorepo, package and tooling conventions
globs: package.json,**/package.json,turbo.json,pnpm-workspace.yaml,tsconfig*.json,**/tsconfig*.json,**/vitest.config.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
- pnpm only. Never use npm or yarn, never commit a second lockfile.
- Pin exact versions (no `^`) for tooling already pinned at the root; use `workspace:*` for internal packages.
- Run tasks through the root scripts (turbo). Each package exposes `build`, `test`, `typecheck`; web also has `lint`.
- `@dekko/core` is source-only: `main` and `exports` point at `src/index.ts`. Do not add tsup or a `dist`.
- Any package that imports `@dekko/core` in a Next app must be listed in `transpilePackages`.
- tsconfigs extend `tsconfig.base.json`. Do not duplicate its compiler options.
- Prettier uses the default config. Do not add custom lint or format rules without a decision in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
- Turbo and Next write agent-guidance blocks into AGENTS.md files. Leave those blocks as generated.
- Check the installed turbo docs (`node_modules/turbo/docs`) before changing `turbo.json`.
